nts for a mortgage Loan.<br>4 Actual loan eligible amount depends on various factors such as credit history, prevailing interest rates and bank''s credit policy."},{"ProductName":"Remortgage","productRef":"REMORTGAGE","ProductDescription":"Remortgage","purposeName":"Remortgage","ProductDetailedDescrip')||TO_CLOB('tion":"Transfer your existing mortgage loan held with another lender to us.","desc":"Get a remortgage loan worth up to 90% of your current property value.","ProductNotes":"Apply for a remortgage loan and get a better interest rate.|+|Switch your mortgage loan and choose to apply for additional loan amount.|+|Avail zero processing fees on your remortgage loan.|+|Enjoy flexible monthly repayment options with a tenure of up to 360 months.","imageDetails":[{"imageUrl":"landingpage_3_mortgageImg1.png","imageType":"Icon"}],"ProductTermsAndConditions":"1 Estimate obtained based on the information provided by the user. It does not constitute an offer for the application for a mortgage loan.<br>2 The application, granting and amount of the mortgage Loan will be subject to subsequent approval by our risks department.<br>3 Provided that you fulfil all our eligibilty requirements for a mortgage Loan.<br>4 Actual loan eligible amount depends on various factors such as credit history, prevailing interest rates and bank''s credit policy."}],"mcmsProductId":"MORTGAGE.OFFER"}'),'CLIENT','1','0','ALL');
